This project patches and redistributes build instructions for OpenAI's Codex
(https://github.com/openai/codex), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The patch in plaintext-delivery.patch modifies codex-rs sources at tag
rust-v0.155.0-alpha.9.2. Prebuilt release binaries are unmodified builds of
those patched sources. This project is unofficial and not affiliated with
OpenAI.
